// Juniper, June, about nine (T4.4). Never known anything but the Hollow. A first meeting; her arc and trust come with T4.6.
npc: juniper
name: June
trust: yes
start: back [flag:met_june]
start: first

node: first
  on_enter: {flag:met_june}
  juniper (shy): "..."
  juniper (humming): "Hm hm hm-hm. Oh. Sorry. I do that. Are you from the other side of the tunnel? Marrow says there is a lot of side of it."
  > "Yes. It is very large and very loud." -> loud
  > "What are you humming?" -> tune
  > "Goodbye." -> goodbye

node: back
  juniper (shy): "Hello again. Hm. Hm-hm."
  > [flag:tune_known, !flag:june_tune] "Bede taught me the end of your song." {flag:june_tune, trust:juniper+1(sang the end of her song)} -> tune_end
  > [!flag:awake_juniper] "Do you want to know what is outside?" -> outside
  > [bring:juniper, !flag:companion=juniper] "Will you come with me? Out through the tunnel, to the other side." {flag:companion=juniper} -> comes
  > [flag:companion=juniper] "I cannot take you after all." {flag:companion=none} -> released
  > "What are you humming?" -> tune
  > "Hush, please. You are very loud." {trust:juniper-1(told her to hush)} -> hushed
  > "Goodbye." -> goodbye

node: loud
  juniper (curious): "Louder than the pump? I do not believe you. Is it true they have no tomatoes?"
  > "Not real ones." -> tune
  > "Goodbye." -> goodbye

node: tune
  juniper (humming): "It is the one Bede sings to the seedlings. I do not know the end of it. Nobody does. Do you know the end?"
  > "Not yet." -> back

node: tune_end
  juniper (radiant): "It goes down. Down, and home, to where it started. Oh. Oh, it was never unfinished. Say it again. No, do not say it again, I will keep it."
  > "It is yours." -> back

node: outside
  juniper (curious): "You said louder than the pump. What is it really like? Marrow says not to ask."
  > "Loud, and large, and dangerous. Nothing has a roof. There is a thing called the sky and it goes all the way up." {flag:awake_juniper=person} -> truth
  > "Not now." -> back

node: truth
  juniper (steady): "All the way up. Hm. That is a great deal of up. I think I would like to see it, even if I am frightened. Is that all right? Is it all right to be frightened and go?"
  > "It is the only way to go." -> back

node: comes
  juniper (steady): "Marrow said I may, if you are the one. I will be quiet. I will try. If I hum, put your hand on my head, like Bede does, and I will stop."
  > "Thank you, June." -> back

node: released
  juniper (small): "Oh. All right. I will wait here, with the tomatoes."
  > "I am sorry." -> back

node: hushed
  juniper (small): "Sorry. I am sorry. I will be quiet."
  > "It is all right." -> back

node: goodbye
  juniper (shy): "Hm hm. Bye."
  end
